{"id":"vod_md_3674","vodId":"3674","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"Rewrite","name_cn":"Rewrite","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230829-1/ba4a1f296db7575dbcd7964c93dc59a0.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为“风祭”的都市之中，天王寺瑚太朗（森田成一 配音）是一名平凡的高中生，过着风平浪静的生活。一年一度的收获祭即将到来，这个热闹欢快的祭典让整个城市都陷入了欢乐而躁动的海洋之中。瑚太郎接受了一份寻找新闻线索的工作，于是开始了在城市各处的奔走，在此过程中，只存在于都市传说之中的怪奇事件和神秘生物渐渐浮出了水面，与此同时，瑚太郎的身边亦发生了许多令他百思不得其解的怪事。为此，瑚太郎找到了超自然研究会的会长千里朱音（喜多村英梨 配音），希望后者能够解答他的疑惑，哪知道在两人调查的过程中，瑚太郎的一干好友纷纷被卷入了风暴之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-29 08:12:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/U1DAnFtj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/OLf3or6s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/IOSpuLy2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/RP12QL7H/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/gPAiZzUV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/gXoTjDyL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/UEeaQIff/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/fYjHNFWQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/w0A1kOaI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/gCrPHjE0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/gQcyYfUa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/FsPd6Cgp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/9lkbPYjE/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:56.192Z"}